title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"67556","synopsis":"Summer has arrived, and once final exams are over, Yuno and her friends enjoy the beginning of their summer vacation. Due to Yuno not knowing how to swim, Miyako gets out an inflatable pool that Yuno and her friends play in, though they eventually go to the beach.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e4X1rdMej0zYNuWkLKui6cNkS2l.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Summer has arrived, and once final exams are over, Yuno and her friends enjoy the beginning of their summer vacation. Due to Yuno not knowing how to swim, Miyako gets out an inflatable pool that Yuno and her friends play in, though they eventually go to the beach.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e4X1rdMej0zYNuWkLKui6cNkS2l.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"67557","synopsis":"A typhoon hits during the say of the Sports Festival and has to be called off until the next day when the typhoon has already blown over. Later on, Yuno and her friends are in Miyako's room worried that if the drying agents under her floor get wet they will ignite and catch the building on fire. Miyako gets the idea to remove them all, and throws one into the rain outside, but it does not catch fire.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/20jz2VwbLfbagsfkSFyaPyRJrwt.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"A typhoon hits during the say of the Sports Festival and has to be called off until the next day when the typhoon has already blown over. Later on, Yuno and her friends are in Miyako's room worried that if the drying agents under her floor get wet they will ignite and catch the building on fire. Miyako gets the idea to remove them all, and throws one into the rain outside, but it does not catch fire.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/20jz2VwbLfbagsfkSFyaPyRJrwt.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"67558","synopsis":"Yuno and her friends have a day off from school today, and after waking up, Yuno starts to draw. Miyako arrives soon after and sits down with Yuno as they draw various things together. Yuno gets a text message from Sae to come to her apartment from the back way; Miyako jumps off the second story to get there, followed by a terrified Yuno. They find out that Sae is hiding from her editor as she tries to finish her next novel before the deadline.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t1XHjrcdWFYzeOYLReQLaUL8z0c.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Yuno and her friends have a day off from school today, and after waking up, Yuno starts to draw. Miyako arrives soon after and sits down with Yuno as they draw various things together. Yuno gets a text message from Sae to come to her apartment from the back way; Miyako jumps off the second story to get there, followed by a terrified Yuno. They find out that Sae is hiding from her editor as she tries to finish her next novel before the deadline.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t1XHjrcdWFYzeOYLReQLaUL8z0c.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"67559","synopsis":"Yuno and Miyako wake up early in the morning and as they are leaving the apartment building, Yuno spots an envelope on the ground. She notices a man not too far away and it turns out he had dropped it. To show his thanks, he gives Yuno four lottery tickets which were in the envelope. At school, a former student of Yoshinoya comes in to talk to Yuno's class, and Yuno starts wondering about her future dreams as an artist. Near the end of the day, Sae buys the evening paper to check the numbers on the lottery tickets, but no one is a winner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u43RqOWyxECafirk32pb746iiEi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Yuno and Miyako wake up early in the morning and as they are leaving the apartment building, Yuno spots an envelope on the ground. She notices a man not too far away and it turns out he had dropped it. To show his thanks, he gives Yuno four lottery tickets which were in the envelope. At school, a former student of Yoshinoya comes in to talk to Yuno's class, and Yuno starts wondering about her future dreams as an artist. Near the end of the day, Sae buys the evening paper to check the numbers on the lottery tickets, but no one is a winner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u43RqOWyxECafirk32pb746iiEi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"67560","synopsis":"The cultural festival is going on at Yuno's school, but the night before, Yuno had tried to finish a piece for the art gallery but ended up falling asleep before it was finished; Miyako took the painting and put it in the gallery by the time Yuno woke up. At school, Yuno gets praise for her unfinished painting even though she did not intend it to be this way and Yuno's friends all have parts in plays. Later, Yuno and her friends go to a public bathhouse and talk about the festival.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Snrv9AL5H5FkaYqgdhlzjshooO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"The cultural festival is going on at Yuno's school, but the night before, Yuno had tried to finish a piece for the art gallery but ended up falling asleep before it was finished; Miyako took the painting and put it in the gallery by the time Yuno woke up. At school, Yuno gets praise for her unfinished painting even though she did not intend it to be this way and Yuno's friends all have parts in plays. Later, Yuno and her friends go to a public bathhouse and talk about the festival.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Snrv9AL5H5FkaYqgdhlzjshooO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"67561","synopsis":"Yuno and her friends go to the zoo for a school assignment to sketch some of the animals. Yoshinoya dresses up like a tour guide and acts like one on the way to the zoo by pointing things outside the window to the students, but soon becomes very carsick and has to stop. At the zoo, Yuno and her friends go around and see many of the animals. Later, Yoshinoya ends up in front of the Hidamari Apartments, and Yuno and her friends take her to Hiro's apartment when she rests for a time. After she leaves, they discuss some of the rumors they have heard about Yoshinoya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ym1fciJb3NnWCFUiSvfnmHIHVIL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Yuno and her friends go to the zoo for a school assignment to sketch some of the animals. Yoshinoya dresses up like a tour guide and acts like one on the way to the zoo by pointing things outside the window to the students, but soon becomes very carsick and has to stop. At the zoo, Yuno and her friends go around and see many of the animals. Later, Yoshinoya ends up in front of the Hidamari Apartments, and Yuno and her friends take her to Hiro's apartment when she rests for a time. After she leaves, they discuss some of the rumors they have heard about Yoshinoya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ym1fciJb3NnWCFUiSvfnmHIHVIL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1852","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"67562","synopsis":"On Christmas Eve, Sae's younger sister Chika comes to visit and gets to meet Yuno, Miyako, and Hiro too. They show Chika around Yuno's school, and they run into Yoshinoya there who later swings by in a Santa outfit and wishes them Merry Christmas. Chika later comes to Yuno's apartment in the middle of the night after Sae refused to give Chika her autograph. Sae, Miyako, and Hiro come by too and they stay up late into the night. On Christmas day, Chika oversleeps and leaves quickly to meet someone in a neighboring town. Yuno and her friends spend the rest of the day together.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9i361V8tm1ndfdfAEGWH2hNxfQJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"On Christmas Eve, Sae's younger sister Chika comes to visit and gets to meet Yuno, Miyako, and Hiro too. They show Chika around Yuno's school, and they run into Yoshinoya there who later swings by in a Santa outfit and wishes them Merry Christmas. Chika later comes to Yuno's apartment in the middle of the night after Sae refused to give Chika her autograph. Sae, Miyako, and Hiro come by too and they stay up late into the night. On Christmas day, Chika oversleeps and leaves quickly to meet someone in a neighboring town. Yuno and her friends spend the rest of the day together.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9i361V8tm1ndfdfAEGWH2hNxfQJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sou